e_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aF4y7","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T12:04:10Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T12:05:42Z","body":"My bad push messup (git really is bad at indicating what the upstream is)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585234619/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585236823","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100882#issuecomment-2585236823","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100882","id":2585236823,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aF5VX","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T12:12:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T12:44:48Z","body":"But identified the issue, unsure the exact solution that would be best but the following works:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/scene/register_scene_types.cpp b/scene/register_scene_types.cpp\r\nindex 8f6a0d8991..84e93a4f14 100644\r\n--- a/scene/register_scene_types.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/register_scene_types.cpp\r\n@@ -1030,6 +1030,7 @@ void register_scene_types() {\r\n\r\n        OS::get_singleton()->yield(); // may take time to init\r\n\r\n+#ifndef _3D_DISABLED\r\n        // 2D nodes that support navmesh baking need to server register their source geometry parsers.\r\n        MeshInstance2D::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n        MultiMeshInstance2D::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n@@ -1038,7 +1039,6 @@ void register_scene_types() {\r\n        TileMap::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n        TileMapLayer::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n        StaticBody2D::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n-#ifndef _3D_DISABLED\r\n        // 3D nodes that support navmesh baking need to server register their source geometry parsers.\r\n        MeshInstance3D::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n        MultiMeshInstance3D::navmesh_parse_init();\r\n```\r\nAlternatively each of the `navmesh_parse_init` methods can have a `ERR_FAIL_NULL(NavigationServer2D/3D::get_singleton())` added in that method\r\n\r\nNavigation isn't enabled without 3D in any case (currently)\r\n\r\nEdit: Further the navigation servers should always be initialized in `main` or we will crash when running without 3D, will add as review comments instead","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585236823/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585251818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100882#issuecomment-2585251818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100882","id":2585251818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aF8_q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T12:44:37Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T12:44:37Z","body":"Correction to the above, the following works correctly, but needs some additional testing for the navigation function, needs to test for the validity of the navigation server when running in 3D disabled cases:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/main/main.cpp b/main/main.cpp\r\nindex 9c12771df8..8263c8e16f 100644\r\n--- a/main/main.cpp\r\n+++ b/main/main.cpp\r\n@@ -730,6 +730,9 @@ Error Main::test_setup() {\r\n        // Default theme will be initialized later, after modules and ScriptServer are ready.\r\n        initialize_theme_db();\r\n\r\n+       NavigationServer3DManager::initialize_server(); // 3D server first because 2D depends on it.\r\n+       NavigationServer2DManager::initialize_server();\r\n+\r\n        register_scene_types();\r\n        register_driver_types();\r\n\r\n@@ -3348,6 +3351,11 @@ Error Main::setup2(bool p_show_boot_logo) {\r\n        // Default theme will be initialized later, after modules and ScriptServer are ready.\r\n        initialize_theme_db();\r\n\r\n+       MAIN_PRINT(\"Main: Load Navigation\");\r\n+\r\n+       NavigationServer3DManager::initialize_server(); // 3D server first because 2D depends on it.\r\n+       NavigationServer2DManager::initialize_server();\r\n+\r\n        register_scene_types();\r\n        register_driver_types();\r\n\r\n@@ -3418,8 +3426,6 @@ Error Main::setup2(bool p_show_boot_logo) {\r\n\r\n        initialize_physics();\r\n\r\n-       MAIN_PRINT(\"Main: Load Navigation\");\r\n-\r\n        register_server_singletons();\r\n\r\n        // This loads global classes, so it must happen before custom loaders and savers are registered\r\ndiff --git a/modules/navigation/register_types.cpp b/modules/navigation/register_types.cpp\r\nindex 8646039705..dbc9e53035 100644\r\n--- a/modules/navigation/register_types.cpp\r\n+++ b/modules/navigation/register_types.cpp\r\n@@ -66,9 +66,6 @@ void initialize_navigation_module(ModuleInitializationLevel p_level) {\r\n                NavigationServer3DManager::set_default_server(new_navigation_server_3d);\r\n                NavigationServer2DManager::set_default_server(new_navigation_server_2d);\r\n\r\n-               NavigationServer3DManager::initialize_server(); // 3D server first because 2D depends on it.\r\n-               NavigationServer2DManager::initialize_server();\r\n-\r\n #ifndef DISABLE_DEPRECATED\r\n #ifndef _3D_DISABLED\r\n                _nav_mesh_generator = memnew(NavigationMeshGenerator);\r\n```\r\nAlternatively the navigation relevant code in `register_scene_types` should be moved elsewhere after server initialization","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585251818/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585710081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100882#issuecomment-2585710081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100882","id":2585710081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aHs4B","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-12T12:15:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-12T12:15:13Z","body":"Changed the WARN_PRINT() to WARN_VERBOSE() as suggested.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585710081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2597110626","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100882#issuecomment-2597110626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100882","id":2597110626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6azMNi","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T23:24:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T23:24:53Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2597110626/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perf